Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Takes Octavia's entries out of Explorer's right-click menu (what `octavia explorer-menu uninstall` does),
; for when she can't run. Double-click this file and say Yes.

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\*\shell\OctaviaAssistant]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\shell\OctaviaAssistant]

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\Background\shell\OctaviaAssistant]
